/**
 * Pantheon: ten themes for the Hermes desktop app, in one plugin.
 * https://github.com/Adolanium/hermes-pantheon
 *
 * Each theme is a palette, a few style values and three dithered images,
 * registered through the Desktop plugin SDK. IBM Plex is bundled (SIL OFL,
 * see LICENSES/OFL-IBM-Plex.txt), so the plugin makes no network requests.
 *
 * Every selector below is app DOM (data-slot / data-tree-* names), not SDK
 * API. If a Desktop update renames one, that piece of the look falls back to
 * the plain palette rather than breaking anything.
 */

